type: software
title: "Pitching Performance and Elbow Loading"
version: "0.4.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/owengarrett20-svg/pitching-performance-elbow-loading-github-ready"
url: "https://pitching-performance-elbow-loading-app-ready-bpn9pb4j3udcqxo9k.streamlit.app/"
authors:
  - family-names: Garrett
    given-names: Owen
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible exploratory Python study of pitching performance and peak
  internal elbow varus moment using Driveline's OpenBiomechanics Project.
  Includes validated pitch-level joins, missingness audits, descriptive figures,
  athlete-grouped predictor comparisons, conditional paired athlete-cluster
  bootstrap intervals, partition sensitivity, and an educational Streamlit viewer.
  The analysis estimates retrospective associations, not injury risk or causal
  effects of changing mechanics.
keywords:
  - biomechanics
  - baseball
  - pitching
  - reproducible research
  - grouped cross-validation
